SUMMARY:Beer Garden Concert Series: Rose Galaxy Band 🎸🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nNothing beats live music on a summer
  evening with a cold craft beer in hand.\n\nJoin us at The Glass Jug RTP B
 eer Garden for another night in their awesome Beer Garden Concert Series f
 eaturing Rose Galaxy Band. Known for their powerhouse lead vocalist and hi
 gh-energy performances\, they’ll be playing rock and pop hits from the 
 ’90s through today.\n\nThis is one of my favorite types of Meetup events
 —low-key\, easy to mingle\, great music\, and plenty of space to hang ou
 t with old friends and meet some new ones.\n\nThe concert is free\, and th
 e Beer Garden will have plenty of craft beer on tap while a local food tru
 ck serves dinner throughout the evening.\n\nWhat to expect:\n🎶 Live mus
 ic from 6:00–9:00 PM\n🍺 Great local craft beer\n🌮 Food truck on si
 te\n👋 Friendly people and a relaxed summer atmosphere\n\nWe’ll meet u
 p a little before the music starts so everyone has a chance to grab a drin
 k\, find a spot\, and get to know each other before the band kicks things 
 off.\n\nAs always\, whether you’re coming solo or bringing a friend\, yo
 u’ll have a group to hang out with. See you in the Beer Garden!
