SUMMARY:The Fifth Element: Big Screen Event 💫🚕
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nLeeloo Dallas multipass.\n\nSome mov
 ies are fun to watch alone. Some movies are better with a group. The Fifth
  Element is absolutely a group movie. Showtime starts at 4pm but we’ll m
 eet at 3:30pm to mingle and then head in and find our seats.\n\nIt’s col
 orful\, weird\, stylish\, funny\, chaotic\, and somehow still one of the m
 ost entertaining sci-fi movies ever made. Now it’s back on the big scree
 n for a special 2026 event!\n\nJoin us at AMC Southpoint 17 for a night of
  space opera\, flying taxis\, outrageous fashion\, Gary Oldman villain ene
 rgy\, Ruby Rhod chaos\, and one very important multipass.\n\nWhat to expec
 t:\n🎬 The Fifth Element back in theaters\n🍿 Big-screen sci-fi nostal
 gia\n🚕 Flying cars\, aliens\, opera\, action\, and pure ’90s weirdnes
 s\n👋 A fun group of fellow movie lovers\n\nEveryone is responsible for 
 purchasing their own ticket\, so be sure to reserve yours in advance. We
 ’ll coordinate seating in the event comments as we get closer.\n\nCome s
 olo or bring a friend—either way\, we’ll make it a super green night a
 t the movies.
