SUMMARY:O.A.R. Concert (feat Lisa Loeb & Gavin DeGraw)
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nThirty years of O.A.R. means thirty 
 years of road trips\, summer nights\, singalongs\, and feel-good jams.\n\n
 I already grabbed my ticket\, so I figured I’d throw this event out ther
 e in case other Meetup members are going too. Whether you’ve been listen
 ing since That Was a Crazy Game of Poker or just want a great night of liv
 e music\, let’s make it a party.\n\nWe’ll meet up before the show to s
 ay hello\, grab a drink if time allows\, then head in together. During the
  concert we’ll enjoy the music\, dance\, sing\, and soak in three decade
 s of O.A.R. with special guests Gavin DeGraw and Lisa Loeb joining the lin
 eup. The show starts at 6:00 PM at Red Hat Amphitheater in downtown Raleig
 h. (Red Hat Amphitheater)\n\nA few notes:\n\n* 🎟️ Everyone is respons
 ible for purchasing their own ticket.\n* 📍 We’ll meetup at Berkeley C
 afe (about a block away) at 5:30p to grab an affordable beer and walk to t
 he venue. It’s a social district so you can walk over with a drink and s
 ave some $$& before going in!\n\nIf you’re already going\, or have been 
 looking for an excuse to finally see O.A.R. live—come hang with us. The 
 more\, the merrier!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31559
 3563/
